					"nextDialogs": [
						726770710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770710,
					"content": "#等我變成大妖狸，也要像{NICKNAME}這麼厲害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770711,
					"content": "吉法師一定沒問題的！但是，要答應派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770712,
					"content": "派蒙說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770713,
					"content": "嗯…咳咳！吉法師就算變成比五百藏還厲害的妖狸大王，也不要欺負弱小。然後，也不要隨便打架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770714,
					"content": "#不能像那個好大好大的、著火的花那樣，看到{NICKNAME}就冒出來扭來扭去噴火！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770715,
					"content": "那，要什麼時候才能打打？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770716,
						726770717,
						726770718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770716,
					"content": "保護自己的時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726770719,
					"content": "呶…雖然不是很明白，不過，我答應派蒙。不欺負弱小，也不隨便打架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770720,
					"content": "嗯，吉法師真乖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770721,
					"content": "接下來…應該就是五百藏決定的，去八個地方修行的最後一站了呢…",
