					"id": 726771020,
					"content": "好像很有道理的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771024,
					"content": "而且，自己畫的東西，有很多心意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771025
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771025,
					"content": "嗯，一筆一筆把自己心裡想的東西畫出來，很辛苦的事情呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771026,
					"content": "嗯…那給我拍照，是不是很容易、不辛苦，所以沒有很多心意？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771027,
					"content": "欸！不是這樣的，是因為…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771028
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771028,
					"content": "畫畫要好長時間。吉法師會累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771029
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771029,
					"content": "對對！畫畫要好長時間的，吉法師要是一直保持一個姿勢，會很累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771030
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771030,
					"content": "以前被封印變成石頭的時候，就一直站著。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771031
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771031,
					"content": "所以，掙脫封印以後，好長時間裡，腳好難受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771032,
					"content": "嗚哇，聽起來就覺得好辛苦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771033,
					"content": "但是，派蒙可以飛飛。應該腳不會累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771034,
					"content": "喂！飛的時候，全身的幻肢都在運動，很累的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771035,
					"content": "哇！著火的花！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771036,
					"content": "好好聽人說話啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771037,
					"content": "烈焰花？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771038,
					"content": "對喔，在鎮守之森好像確實沒怎麼見過烈焰花…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771039
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771039,
					"content": "吉法師想要嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771040,
					"content": "想要！看起來很暖和。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771041,
					"content": "#那要好好拜託{NICKNAME}喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771042
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771042,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，想要。謝謝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771043
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771043,
					"content": "…感覺也不是很有誠意。還是說，妖狸說話就是這種風格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771021,
					"content": "因為留影機很貴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771022
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771022,
					"content": "欸？！留影機很貴嗎？那平時戰鬥、游泳、爬山，又從山上掉下來會不會弄壞…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771023,
					"content": "嗚哇，不得了，以後要小心才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771006,
					"content": "像風元素？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771007
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771008,
					"content": "吉法師的詞彙量和派蒙一樣豐富…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771009
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771009,
					"content": "和派蒙一樣厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771010,
					"content": "#唔…{NICKNAME}可能不是那個意思，但總之…吉法師就是很聰明呢！哼！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771011,
					"content": "真的很特別呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771012
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771012,
					"content": "#哎？{NICKNAME}的詞彙量是不是有點匱乏…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}